  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> be a variable point on the parabola <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;Then, the locus of the mid-point of the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and the foot of the perpendicular drawn from the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> to the line <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "qRG0O",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "K5gxT",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
